    <li><strong>Newsletter sign-ups:</strong> if you subscribe, we store your email address to send you new drops.</li>
    <li><strong>Usage analytics:</strong> we use Vercel Web Analytics to count page views. It does not use cookies or track you across other sites.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
