    Posts link to brands and stores, some through affiliate programs. Once you leave DRPZNE, the other site's
    privacy policy applies.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>You can unsubscribe from the newsletter at any time, or ask us to delete your email address.</p>

